conextsol-mascot/
├── base/                  ← neutral standing versions
├── poses/
│   ├── greeting/          ← waving, hello
│   ├── pointing/          ← “look at this”
│   ├── thumbs-up/         ← approval / success
│   ├── thinking/          ← analyzing / strategy
│   ├── presenting/        ← open arms / showcase
│   ├── running/           ← energetic / fast
│   ├── celebrating/       ← victory / wins
│   ├── working/           ← laptop / hologram
│   └── power/             ← confident / dynamic
├── expressions/           ← face variations
├── angles/                ← side, 3/4, close-up, etc.
├── with-props/            ← holding objects, icons, screens
└── video-ready/           ← extra clean / high-contrast versions for video
